---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { kitHeadshot } from '~/lib/kit';
---

<Section id="about" label="about" title="Ope, hi.">
  <div class="about">
    <picture class="about__photo">
      <source type="image/webp" srcset={`${kitHeadshot.webp2} 400w, ${kitHeadshot.webp1} 200w`} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 10rem, 18rem" />
      <img src={kitHeadshot.jpg} width="500" height="500" alt="Chris Hartman" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </picture>
    <div class="about__text">
      <p>
        I'm Chris. I taught myself HTML and CSS by breaking MySpace layouts in 2005 and never really stopped. Over
        fifteen years later I build products for a living and more of them for fun: apps, websites, and lately a lot
        of AI tooling, from northeast Ohio.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of my spare hours go to designing and building products; the ones on the homepage, plus whatever I'm
        taking apart in the homelab that week. I've been working in VR and XR environments a lot lately, enough that
        spatial computing is the next thing I want to build for. The rest goes to gaming and hiking Hocking Hills
        whenever I can get there. I also say "ope" more than is strictly necessary.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 18rem) 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-12);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about__photo {
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--k2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about__photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about__text {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about__photo {
      width: 10rem;
    }
    .about__text {
      font-size: var(--text-base);
    }
  }
</style>
